    ],
    "module_designation": "Not applicable",
    "description": "Non-automatic electromechanical weighing instrument with or without lever works; compact weighing instrument with built-in display, keyboard and data interface. The weighing ranges with Max, Min, e and number of verification scale intervals may be chosen within the limits of No. 3.2 of R 76-1 and of Table 1. JL-C is meant for use as a jeweller instrument with carat preset as fixed unit; JL-G has gram as fixed unit; otherwise both do not differ metrologically from a PL...-S instrument."
