      "changes": "Models JL-C and JL-G are added. JL-C is a jeweller instrument and differs metrologically from a PL...-S instrument only in that carat is preset as a fixed unit; JL-G has gram as fixed unit. In all other respects both instruments do not differ metrologically from a PL...-S instrument (see Report N° 1.14 – 03000215, Revision 2). The previous Test Reports N° 1.14 – 03000215/1 and N° 1.14 – 03000215/2 remain valid without any changes."
